[[2047,127,32768,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Open the boot lid.</p><p>1. Release the retaining buttons (1a) and remove the ski holder\nflap (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019450.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,32768,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the ski holder flap is undamaged.</p><p>Place the ski holder flap in position and\nsecure it using the retaining buttons.</p>"],[2047,127,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Lower the rear right seat squab.</p><p>2. Unscrew the bolts</p><p>3. Remove the ski holder flap.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019451.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the ski holder flap is undamaged.</p><p>Fit the ski holder flap in position and\nfix it with the bolts.</p><p>Raise the rear right seat squab.</p>"]]